# Placeholder so this directory exists in git.
#
# The Dockerfile copies `OVERLAY_SRC` (default: this directory) to /app/overlay-src
# and puts it on PYTHONPATH. In the open/self-host build nothing lands there, so
# the optional overlay import in backend/main.py (`find_spec("cloud")`) stays None.
# Vicoa's hosted build overrides OVERLAY_SRC with its closed `cloud` source root.
